{"unit_id": "tag:0H7C:proof", "translation": "若<MATH_0001>是孤立点（isolated point），则<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>的开子集（open subset）（见拓扑（Topology）一章的定义<REF_0001>），因而由定义有<MATH_0004>。反之，若<MATH_0005>，则存在<MATH_0006>，它是<MATH_0007>的开邻域（open neighbourhood），且<MATH_0008>（见拓扑（Topology）一章的定义<REF_0002>）。由引理<REF_0003>，<MATH_0009>上的拓扑（topology）是离散的（discrete），故<MATH_0010>是孤立点（isolated point）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "isolated point", "target_term": "孤立点"}, {"source_term": "open subset", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhood", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "discrete", "target_term": "离散的"}, {"source_term": "isolated point", "target_term": "孤立点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "isolated point", "target_term": "孤立点", "context": "此处为正向证明的假设。"}, {"source_term": "open subset", "target_term": "开子集", "context": "此处由孤立点的定义得到。"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "此处为所引章节名。"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhood", "target_term": "开邻域", "context": "此处为反向证明所取的邻域。"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "此处为所引章节名。"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "此处指该邻域上的拓扑。"}, {"source_term": "discrete", "target_term": "离散的", "context": "此处为由引理得到的拓扑性质。"}, {"source_term": "isolated point", "target_term": "孤立点", "context": "此处为反向证明的结论。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02IV:title", "translation": "链状（Catenary）概形（schemes）", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "此处为本节讨论的概形性质。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "此处为本节讨论的对象。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02IV:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾如下定义。拓扑空间（topological space）<MATH_0001>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>链状的（catenary）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若对每一对不可约（irreducible）闭子集（closed subsets）<MATH_0002>，都存在一条由不可约（irreducible）闭子集（closed subsets）组成的极大（maximal）链（chain）\n<MATH_0003>\n且这样的链（chain）的长度（length）都相同。见拓扑（Topology）一章的定义<REF_0001>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "maximal", "target_term": "极大"}, {"source_term": "chain", "target_term": "链"}, {"source_term": "chain", "target_term": "链"}, {"source_term": "length", "target_term": "长度"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "此处为所定义性质的对象。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处为回顾的拓扑空间性质。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约", "context": "此处限定所取的一对子集。"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "此处为所取的一对子集。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约", "context": "此处限定链中的各子集。"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "此处为链中的各子集。"}, {"source_term": "maximal", "target_term": "极大", "context": "此处要求链在所述条件下是极大的。"}, {"source_term": "chain", "target_term": "链", "context": "此处为所要求存在的子集链。"}, {"source_term": "chain", "target_term": "链", "context": "此处指满足上述条件的每一条链。"}, {"source_term": "length", "target_term": "长度", "context": "此处指各链相同的长度。"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "此处为所引章节名。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02IW:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。我们称<MATH_0002>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>链状的（catenary）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若<MATH_0003>的底层拓扑空间（topological space）是链状的（catenary）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "此处为定义的对象。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处为所定义的概形性质。"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "此处为概形的底层空间。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处为底层拓扑空间的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02IV:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾如下定义。环（ring）<MATH_0001>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>链状的（catenary）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若对任意一对素（prime）理想（ideals）<MATH_0002>，都存在一条由素理想（primes）组成的极大（maximal）链（chain）\n<MATH_0003>\n且这些链的长度（length）都相同。见代数（Algebra）一章的定义<REF_0001>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素"}, {"source_term": "ideals", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "primes", "target_term": "素理想"}, {"source_term": "maximal", "target_term": "极大"}, {"source_term": "chain", "target_term": "链"}, {"source_term": "length", "target_term": "长度"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "此处为所定义性质的对象。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处为回顾的环的性质。"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素", "context": "此处限定所取的两个理想。"}, {"source_term": "ideals", "target_term": "理想", "context": "此处为所取的一对理想。"}, {"source_term": "primes", "target_term": "素理想", "context": "此处指链中的各素理想。"}, {"source_term": "maximal", "target_term": "极大", "context": "此处要求素理想链是极大的。"}, {"source_term": "chain", "target_term": "链", "context": "此处指所要求存在的素理想链。"}, {"source_term": "length", "target_term": "长度", "context": "此处要求所有这些链等长。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "此处为所引章节名。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02IX:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。以下条件等价（equivalent）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>是链状的（catenary），\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0003>有一个开（open）覆盖（covering），其每个成员都是链状（catenary）概形（schemes），\n<STRUCT_0004> 对每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0004>，环（ring）<MATH_0005>都是链状的（catenary），以及\n<STRUCT_0005> 存在仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0006>，使得每个<MATH_0007>都是某个链状（catenary）环（ring）的谱（spectrum）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n此外，在这种情况下，<MATH_0008>的任一局部（locally）闭子概形（closed subscheme）也都是链状的（catenary）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "此处为引理中的对象。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "此处指各条件互相等价。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处为第一个条件中的概形性质。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "此处限定覆盖的成员是开集。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "此处指第二个条件中存在的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "此处修饰覆盖中各概形。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "此处指开覆盖中的各概形。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "此处指第三个条件逐一考察的开集。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "此处指给定仿射开集所对应的环。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处为第三个条件要求的环的性质。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "此处限定覆盖成员是仿射开集。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "此处指第四个条件中存在的仿射开覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "此处修饰用于取谱的环。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "此处指用于取谱的链状环。"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱", "context": "此处指环的谱。"}, {"source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部", "context": "此处限定子概形的闭性是局部的。"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "此处与局部合用，指附加结论中的单位对象。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处与局部合用，指附加结论所涉及的子概形。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02IX:proof", "translation": "将拓扑（Topology）一章的引理<REF_0001>与代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0002>结合起来即可。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "此处为第一个所引章节名。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "此处为第二个所引章节名。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02IY:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（scheme）。\n以下条件等价（equivalent）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>是链状的（catenary），且\n<STRUCT_0003> 在扎里斯基（Zariski）拓扑（topology）下，局部存在定义在<MATH_0003>上的维数（dimension）函数（function）（见拓扑（Topology）一章的定义<REF_0001>）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}, {"source_term": "Zariski", "target_term": "扎里斯基"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "此处为引理的假设。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "此处为引理中的对象。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "此处指以下两个条件互相等价。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处为第一个条件中的概形性质。"}, {"source_term": "Zariski", "target_term": "扎里斯基", "context": "此处指明取局部时所用的拓扑。"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "此处规定局部存在所用的拓扑。"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "此处限定所要求存在的函数。"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数", "context": "此处与维数合用，指局部存在的函数。"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "此处为所引章节名。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02IY:proof", "translation": "这一结论可由拓扑（Topology）一章的引理<REF_0001>、<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>、概形（Schemes）一章的引理<REF_0004>以及最后的引理<REF_0005>推出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "此处为前三条引理所在章节名。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "此处为第四条引理所在章节名。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02IV:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n结果表明，概形（scheme）是链状的（catenary），当且仅当它的各个局部环（local rings）都是链状的（catenary）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "此处为陈述中的对象。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处为概形所具备的等价性质。"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "此处指概形的所有局部环。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处为每个局部环所具备的等价性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02J0:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。以下条件等价（equivalent）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>是链状的（catenary），且\n<STRUCT_0003> 对任意<MATH_0003>，局部环（local ring）<MATH_0004>都是链状的（catenary）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "此处为引理中的对象。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "此处指所列两项条件互相等价。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处为第一项条件中的概形性质。"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "此处为第二项条件逐一考察的环。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处为第二项条件中的局部环性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02J0:proof", "translation": "假设<MATH_0001>是链状的（catenary）。设<MATH_0002>。由引理<REF_0001>，可将<MATH_0003>替换为<MATH_0004>的一个仿射开（affine open）邻域（neighbourhood），此时<MATH_0005>是链状（catenary）环（ring）。由代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0002>，链状（catenary）环（ring）的任意局部化（localization）都是链状的（catenary）。因此<MATH_0006>是链状的（catenary）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n反之，假设<MATH_0007>的所有局部环（local rings）都是链状的（catenary）。设<MATH_0008>是<MATH_0009>中不可约（irreducible）闭子集（closed subsets）之间的一个包含关系（inclusion）。设<MATH_0010>为泛点（generic point）。设<MATH_0011>为与<MATH_0012>的泛点（generic point）对应的素理想（prime），见概形（Schemes）一章的引理<REF_0003>。由同一引理，<MATH_0013>中介于<MATH_0014>和<MATH_0015>之间的不可约（irreducible）闭子集（closed subsets）对应于满足下述条件的素理想（primes）<MATH_0016>，即<MATH_0017>。\n于是可见，所有这样的极大（maximal）链（chains）都是有限（finite）的，且长度（length）都相同，因为<MATH_0018>是链状（catenary）环（ring）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "inclusion", "target_term": "包含关系"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素理想"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "primes", "target_term": "素理想"}, {"source_term": "maximal", "target_term": "极大"}, {"source_term": "chains", "target_term": "链"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "length", "target_term": "长度"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处为正向证明中概形的假设。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "此处修饰为所取点选取的邻域。"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "此处指进行局部替换时选取的邻域。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "此处修饰替换后得到的环。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "此处指替换后与仿射开邻域对应的环。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "此处为所引章节名。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "此处修饰进行局部化的环。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "此处为所引用局部化结论中的环。"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化", "context": "此处指取环的局部化。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处为任意上述局部化的性质。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处为正向证明所得的结论。"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "此处指反向证明所假设的全部局部环。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状的", "context": "此处为反向证明对全部局部环作的假设。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约", "context": "此处限定所取包含关系中的子集。"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "此处为所取包含关系中的子集。"}, {"source_term": "inclusion", "target_term": "包含关系", "context": "此处指所取两个子集之间的关系。"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "此处为所取的泛点。"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "此处为与所取素理想对应的泛点。"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素理想", "context": "此处为对应于第二个所述泛点的素理想。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "此处为所引章节名。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约", "context": "此处限定介于两个给定子集之间的子集。"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "此处为参与所述对应的子集。"}, {"source_term": "primes", "target_term": "素理想", "context": "此处为与中间子集对应的素理想。"}, {"source_term": "maximal", "target_term": "极大", "context": "此处限定所考察的链。"}, {"source_term": "chains", "target_term": "链", "context": "此处为通过对应关系考察的各条链。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "此处指每条所述极大链的有限性。"}, {"source_term": "length", "target_term": "长度", "context": "此处指各条极大链共同的长度。"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "此处修饰用于推出等长结论的环。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "此处为反向证明中运用链状性质的环。"}], "notes": []}
